intent: paper 5.9: exploratory, NOT pre-registered — crosses the concurrency and footprint-noise axes (nool_gated vs git_scheduled, corpus v3.1, very-heavy noise 0.5/0.5, N=35/40/45, n=2-3 reps). Gap 2.5/5.0/11.7 pp, larger at N=45 than the 6.7 pp maximum at fixed N=20 in 5.7, but non-monotonic point-to-point and below this suite's 3+/5+ replication convention. Records the unexplained wall-time reversal at N=40/45 as an observation, not a mechanism claim
